<Base title="Terms and Disclaimer" description="Terms of use and disclaimer for Network Academy content and generated configurations.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms and disclaimer</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-neutral mt-6 dark:prose-invert">
      <h2>Educational use</h2>
      <p>Everything on this site is provided for education. Lessons, examples, labs and tools are supplied "as is", without warranty of any kind, and may contain errors or be out of date.</p>
      <h2>Configurations can cause outages</h2>
      <p>Network changes can disconnect devices, interrupt service and create security exposure. Configurations produced by the generator, and commands in lessons, must be reviewed, adapted to your environment, and tested in a lab before use on a live network. Keep console access and a rollback plan available. You are responsible for what you deploy.</p>
      <h2>BGP and the public internet</h2>
      <p>Announcing routes to the internet affects other networks. Only announce address space and AS numbers you are authorised to use, and filter every session.</p>
      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, the authors are not liable for any loss or damage arising from use of this site or its content.</p>
